# campaigns' sequence editor and launch (gamma-p3-050; core/modules/campaigns/README.md "Routes",
# "Launch checks"): a member's session; the writes take campaigns.write (Owner and Admin), the checks
# campaigns.read. A save is the campaign's next version, which only new enrollments join; the same
# steps again write nothing. The launch reads every check again under the campaign's lock and moves
# a draft only. `campaignId` is a campaign of your workspace (GET …/campaigns): put it in
# http-client.private.env.json with your workspaceId. A write sends the cookie, so it sends Origin:
# {{appOrigin}} too (the api's origin check).

### PUT /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/campaigns/{campaignId}/sequence: saves the steps as the campaign's next version, a delay in business days on each step but the connection request, the first message and, with the fallback, the first email, at most limits.maxStepDelayBusinessDays (CAMPAIGNS_MAX_STEP_DELAY_BUSINESS_DAYS, 30 unset); the version's number and steps; 400 campaign_sequence_invalid with details.rule, 409 campaign_archived, 404 campaign_not_found
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/sequence
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

{
  "steps": [
    { "action": "invite" },
    { "action": "message" },
    { "action": "message", "delayBusinessDays": 3 },
    { "action": "email" },
    { "action": "email", "delayBusinessDays": 3 }
  ],
  "emailFallback": true
}

### PATCH /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/campaigns/{campaignId}: renames the campaign, its name trimmed; 400 campaign_name_invalid outside 1 to 80 characters, 404 campaign_not_found
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/campaigns/{{campaignId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

{ "name": "Warm leads" }

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/campaigns/{campaignId}/launch-checks: each launch check read now for the campaign's owner, its LinkedIn account, the disclosure and the credits, with its code when it fails; 404 campaign_not_found
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/launch-checks
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/campaigns/{campaignId}/launch: the draft campaign active, with its launch time, once every check passes again; 409 campaign_launch_blocked with details.checks, 409 campaign_not_draft, 404 campaign_not_found
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/launch
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
